{"In admin_group_route.js, afterModel has been removed and setupController now calls model.findMembers() without awaiting its promise, causing potential race condition": 0.6059252023696899, "Tests updated to cover new group membership endpoints and behavior including admin controller specs for index, update, refresh_automatic_groups, add_members, and remove_member flows": 0.11939876526594162, "Admin-group.js.es6 controller includes client-side pagination helpers and separate usernames input, creating risk of desynchronization between UI state and server data": 0.13278397917747498, "Group admin UI templates were heavily rewritten, introducing breaking change for UI layer or embedded components that depend on old markup/structure": 0.11132534593343735, "Group.findMembers returns undefined if group's name is blank and uses /members.json with limit/offset, changing API contract and affecting callers expecting a Promise": 0.8241084218025208, "Admin-group-selector template removal will result in runtime error or missing UI if Ember app still references this template": 0.03925270959734917, "Admin groups controller overhauled with changed create/update endpoints and added add_members/remove_member, breaking backward compatibility": 0.10787796229124069, "GroupsController#posts now paginates group members and returns meta object with total/limit/offset, altering client expectations for response shape": 0.33286333084106445, "Routes.rb exposes add/remove member actions on /members and adds refresh_automatic_groups on collection, shifting client expectations away from RESTful nested routes": 0.06947808712720871, "Test suite references :posts action but updated code introduces members endpoint with JSON payload for pagination, causing potential test mismatch": 0.004290672019124031, "group_member.hbs template gates remove button with '#unless automatic' but automatic property belongs to parent group not member, potentially showing/hiding button incorrectly": 0.8444920182228088, "T